comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T19:38:17.942Z",codex-root,"This is the only item to claim and mark in_progress because it is the concrete item whose source, tests, and docs are being edited."
  "2026-08-07T19:52:36.850Z",codex-root,Implemented the stable Core bootstrap integration subscription through the existing bounded collector; normalized only finite nonnegative timings into deterministic rows; synchronized capability and machine-schema discovery; repaired non-interactive setup to emit one privacy-safe formatter receipt while preserving interactive prose.
  "2026-08-07T19:59:12.303Z",codex-root,"Pull request #95 opened at exact implementation head 6688dc0: https://github.com/unbraind/homeassistant-cli/pull/95. The body links all four canonical PM artifacts and records official contracts, privacy boundaries, local/live gates, and no-publication scope."
