learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-07T19:38:17.942Z",codex-root,The existing bounded subscription collector already centralizes unsubscribe cleanup; extend its explicit union and reuse it rather than create a second transport.
  "2026-08-07T19:56:01.268Z",codex-root,"Linked tests that invoke quality:pm must run with tracker PM context; the default schema sandbox intentionally contains no project items and therefore makes strict orphan checks fail."
