body: "Implement without any, dynamic imports, guessed external types, artificial branches, ignore directives, or trivial one-use wrappers. Normalize Core Record<string, number> events into deterministic domain/elapsed rows, retain snapshot counts, bound duration/events, and always unsubscribe. Add capability/schema/help/docs/live E2E coverage. Refactor wizard connection testing to return typed data rather than print; format once in non-interactive mode and preserve interactive prose. Validate exact output schemas and secure isolated files."
